lifornia out of the union, something that is NOT POSSIBLE AT THE MOMENT.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, the federal government could simply pack up, and exit California, removing (selling) all their buildings, and selling off the federal land, and moving the federal employees out of the state (or they are fired); and then stop giving California ANY more money.</p>\n<p>This is as effective as forcing them to leave the union.</p>\n<p>Even if the next Democrat restores all this, it will kick california so hard in the balls they'll be coughing up testicles for the next couple years and many many years to recover after that.</p>\n<p>They already blame Trump for everything, so why not do this?</p>\n<p>Sends a cautionary message to all other states that they need to stop fucking around and playing games with the rest of the country.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 20, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0YES\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2090475778505146673", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCNODc3k", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 282, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8790898, "raw_content": "", "author": "kinbergfan", "created": 1787273522321, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "MAG-n-KAG", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCNODc3k.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/Tironianae/status/2090475778505146673", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resi